{
  "name": "WF-P5 — Frescura de stock",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "p5fr-sticky",
      "name": "Notas — WF-P5 Frescura",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [60, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## P5 punto 1 — Frescura de stock\n\n2 triggers independientes en el mismo workflow:\n\n**A) Cron diario** — pausa automática de unidades activas sin confirmar hace >14 días. Por unidad, silencioso, no genera email.\n\n**B) Cron quincenal** — un único email genérico por showroom (no por unidad), recordando la política. Excluye showrooms con `feed_sync` activo.\n\n**Simplificación v1, a propósito**: la exclusión de feed_sync solo mira `dealers.subscription_plan = 'elite'` (que lo incluye por defecto) — no comprueba todavía `organization_feature_overrides` (el add-on de pago en Essential/Professional). Verificado que hoy son 0 overrides activos, así que es equivalente ahora mismo — revisar si algún dealer no-Elite compra el add-on.\n\n**Variables necesarias:** SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY, MARKET_URL\n\n**EXCLUSION CATALOGO DEMO (2026-09-22)**: el cron diario excluye por dealer_id los 12 showrooms del catalogo demo/showcase (sin dueño real que confirme stock) — si no, se pausan solos cada vez que se reactivan porque last_confirmed_at nunca se refresca. Lista de IDs en el propio filtro del nodo \"Supabase — Vehiculos caducados\". Si se anaden mas showrooms demo en el futuro, hay que anadir su id ahi tambien.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 340
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p5fr-cron-daily",
      "name": "Cron diario — pausa por caducidad",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [460, 160],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": { "interval": [{ "field": "days", "triggerAtHour": 4 }] }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p5fr-get-stale",
      "name": "Supabase — Vehículos caducados",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, 160],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/vehicles",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "status", "value": "eq.active" },
            { "name": "last_confirmed_at", "value": "=lt.{{ new Date(Date.now() - 14*24*60*60*1000).toISOString() }}" },
            { "name": "select", "value": "id" },
            { "name": "limit", "value": "500" },
            { "name": "dealer_id", "value": "not.in.(3f901ac8-9373-5194-9242-378481972cfe,1b442abf-9e9d-512a-8690-7f742b4d5970,bef7efe3-e2d6-5f2e-beaa-45e5f80fd56f,2113eadb-f8d7-4fa4-b3d1-0ad9061c98a3,246c3c5b-ef9a-4a7e-9439-e6175f9e0bdd,0e537b4a-270f-5fe9-9ae0-bdd2fd70f577,a9ed6bf3-018d-5371-880c-311aa3734a20,c14d4ae9-af87-56b8-a3ce-1ee71b79a20c,2e94a552-4560-546f-862d-b423432d714a,271d4496-df80-5701-8cc6-ca1e7bdc93a6,93661d53-f9f8-523d-9d2f-4e6627bdc61a,ac8258ac-7a2f-5fb6-99c3-c9882e631b01)" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p5fr-pause-stale",
      "name": "Supabase — Pausar por caducidad",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [900, 160],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/vehicles",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
            { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=minimal" }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "id", "value": "=eq.{{ $json.id }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "raw",
        "body": "={ \"status\": \"paused\", \"freshness_auto_paused\": true }",
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "neverError": true } } }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p5fr-cron-biweekly",
      "name": "Cron quincenal — recordatorio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [460, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": { "interval": [{ "field": "weeks", "weeksInterval": 2, "triggerAtHour": 9, "triggerAtDayOfWeek": 1 }] }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p5fr-get-dealers",
      "name": "Supabase — Showrooms activos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/dealers",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "status", "value": "eq.active" },
            { "name": "select", "value": "id,name,email,subscription_plan" },
            { "name": "limit", "value": "500" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p5fr-filter-non-elite",
      "name": "Excluir feed_sync (Elite)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [900, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const dealers = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\nreturn dealers\n  .filter(d => d.subscription_plan !== 'elite' && d.email)\n  .map(d => ({ json: d }));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p5fr-remind-prep",
      "name": "Preparar recordatorio de frescura",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const d = $input.first().json;\nconst MARKET_URL = process.env.MARKET_URL || 'https://blacklabelmarket.es';\nconst MAIL_FROM = 'Black Label Market <notificaciones@blacklabelmarket.es>';\n\nconst html = `<p>Hola,</p>\n<p>Recuerda mantener tu stock actualizado según nuestras políticas de publicación — confirma disponibilidad, actualiza precios o retira lo que ya no esté disponible.</p>\n<p><a href=\"${MARKET_URL}/dashboard/estado\">Revisar mi stock →</a></p>\n<p>El equipo de Black Label Market</p>`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...d, emailPayload: { from: MAIL_FROM, to: [d.email], subject: 'Recuerda mantener tu stock actualizado', html } } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p5fr-send-remind",
      "name": "Enviar recordatorio de frescura",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1340, 400],
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $json.emailPayload.from }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.emailPayload.to[0] }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.emailPayload.subject }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "html": "={{ $json.emailPayload.html }}"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": { "id": "ktAl9FVvAn6iPZRo", "name": "Hostinger SMTP - notificaciones" }
      },
      "continueOnFail": true
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Cron diario — pausa por caducidad": { "main": [[{ "node": "Supabase — Vehículos caducados", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Supabase — Vehículos caducados": { "main": [[{ "node": "Supabase — Pausar por caducidad", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Cron quincenal — recordatorio": { "main": [[{ "node": "Supabase — Showrooms activos", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Supabase — Showrooms activos": { "main": [[{ "node": "Excluir feed_sync (Elite)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Excluir feed_sync (Elite)": { "main": [[{ "node": "Preparar recordatorio de frescura", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Preparar recordatorio de frescura": { "main": [[{ "node": "Enviar recordatorio de frescura", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "tags": []
}
